<title>DUBAI: SOCCER-BANGLADESH BEAT TAIWAN 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BANGLADESH BEAT TAIWAN 2-1 IN WORLD CUP QUALIFIER.</headline>
<dateline>DUBAI 1997-03-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bangladesh beat Taiwan 2-1</p>
<p>(halftime 1-0) in a World Cup Asian Zone group one qualifer in</p>
<p>Jeddah on Saturday.</p>
<p>Scorers:</p>
<p>Bangladesh: Mohammed al-Amin 45, Imtiyaz Ahmed 81</p>
<p>Taiwan: Hu Sen 53.</p>
<p>Attendance: 20,000</p>
</text>
